  "source": {
    "html": "<html lang=\"en\" data-theme=\"light\"><head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>Tokens fixture</title>\n<!--\n  The cascade cases the capture's token reader has to get right: a token\n  in a shorthand, a literal beating a token by specificity, !important\n  beating specificity, an inline style, and a second theme.\n  Captured with `authoredTokens` (the file name says so).\n  see docs/plans/react-import-plan.md\n-->\n<style>\n  :root { --surface: #eef3f9; --ink: #1d2732; --space: 16px; --accent: #0a84a5; }\n  [data-theme=\"dark\"] { --surface: #16181c; --ink: #f3f3f7; }\n  body { margin: 0; font: 14px/20px system-ui, sans-serif; }\n  .panel { padding: var(--space) 8px; background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink); }\n  .panel.plain { background: #ffffff; }\n  .badge { color: var(--accent) !important; }\n  main .badge { color: red; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main>\n    <section class=\"panel\"><p>Tokens all the way</p></section>\n    <section class=\"panel plain\"><p>A literal background</p></section>\n    <span class=\"badge\">Important wins</span>\n    <div style=\"border: 2px solid var(--accent)\">Inline</div>\n  </main>\n\n\n</body></html>",
    "css": "/* <style> */\n:root { --surface: #eef3f9; --ink: #1d2732; --space: 16px; --accent: #0a84a5; }\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] { --surface: #16181c; --ink: #f3f3f7; }\nbody { margin: 0px; font: 14px / 20px system-ui, sans-serif; }\n.panel { padding: var(--space) 8px; background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink); }\n.panel.plain { background: rgb(255, 255, 255); }\n.badge { color: var(--accent) !important; }\nmain .badge { color: red; }",
